        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/85e7bf/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-08T05:44:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How many times can you use an ongoing effect a turn? For example with Wrest the Mind from Visionary you can redirect damage from one target to another so with Grand Warlord Voss can you redirect the 3 damage back to GWV and then redirect the 2 damage to GWV?<br>\nAlso does this count as Visonary dealing the damage or the original person dealing the damage?<br>\nFor cards that say “if the target leaves play, destroy this card” if the villain flips does it destroy that card?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:34.296Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
