        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "How many times can you use an ongoing effect a turn? For example with Wrest the Mind from Visionary you can redirect damage from one target to another so with Grand Warlord Voss can you redirect the 3 damage back to GWV and then redirect the 2 damage to GWV?\nAlso does this count as Visonary dealing the damage or the original person dealing the damage?\nFor cards that say \"if the target leaves play, destroy this card\" if the villain flips does it destroy that card?",
